},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Jan'mo the Loud says: Legends say it took our warlock TWO soul shards to summon the next contender! He's big, he's blue, and he doesn't like this place! It's Guth'kar!",
