},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Jan'mo the Loud says: Not one, not two, but three former champions have returned for one night only! It might be a bad day to be on the floor, but it's a great day to be watching!",
