},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Jan'mo the Loud says: It's time for the main event, the championship fight you've all been waiting for! The plucky upstarts versus your hero, and mine, Drakta!",
