rx1\",\"id\":\"s50_4110\",\"timestamp\":1781651188},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Whether it was arcane, fel, or even Light or... Void, Dath'Remar created the Omnium to preserve knowledge within.\",\"id\":\"s50_4111\",\"timestamp\":1781651194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: But when King Anasterian fell, the Omnium shut down--not even Kael'thas knew how to revive it.\",\"id\":\"s50_4112\",\"timestamp\":1781651207},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna begins singing.\",\"id\":\"s50_4113\",\"timestamp\":1781651208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Uuna:84:SAY:|h[Uuna]|h says: Tulip's sister, pure and humble! Seeks to... something...\",\"id\":\"s50_4114\",\"timestamp\":1781651208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna mumbles.\",\"id\":\"s50_4115\",\"timestamp\":1781651208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s50_4116\",\"timestamp\":1781651217},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Manyfaced plants the Flag of Ownership in the corpse of Phatdotts.\",\"id\":\"s50_4117\",\"timestamp\":1781651221},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s50_4118\",\"timestamp\":1781651248},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Unauthorized Magister detected. Sunstrider security ward engaged.\",\"id\":\"s50_4119\",\"timestamp\":1781651265},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Dath'Remar Sunstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Dath'Remar Sunstrider says: The limitless pursuit of knowledge is not for the unworthy!\",\"id\":\"s50_4120\",\"timestamp\":1781651268},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: So why is it active now? And what's causing it to malfunction? Do you think Kael'thas--\",\"id\":\"s50_4121\",\"timestamp\":1781651293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Damaged it? No. Apart from the stench of fel, the Omnium was still silent when found in his possessions.\",\"id\":\"s50_4122\",\"timestamp\":1781651302},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Kael'thas Sunstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Kael'thas Sunstrider says: Not recognized? I am a Sunstrider! The Omnium belongs to ME!\",\"id\":\"s50_4123\",\"timestamp\":1781651304},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Then if it was still dormant when you recovered it, could it somehow have been damaged before the King was slain?\",\"id\":\"s50_4124\",\"timestamp\":1781651317},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: The Omnium was well protected here in the Magisters' Terrace... until Silvermoon fell under attack.\",\"id\":\"s50_4125\",\"timestamp\":1781651326},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s50_4126\",\"timestamp\":1781651333},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: There was much carnage that day, Rommath. Perhaps these anomalies can tell us more.\",\"id\":\"s50_4127\",\"timestamp\":1781651333},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx150\",\"id\":\"s50_4128\",\"timestamp\":1781651336},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: If I can find the missing component Dar'Khan ripped from the Omnium, will you be able to recalibrate and stabilize it?\",\"id\":\"s50_4129\",\"timestamp\":1781651340},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: I will. Belo'vir should have locked the Grand Magister's key-cipher in his study... well, now my study.\",\"id\":\"s50_4130\",\"timestamp\":1781651349},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Crashcake-Quel'dorei\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Crashcake-Quel'dorei|h[|cffc41e3aCrashcake-Quel'dorei|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62606:Player-1185-08AC1E24:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Sunstrider Omnium]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4131\",\"timestamp\":1781651350},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: His safeguards will need to be unraveled. I will meet our champion there.\",\"id\":\"s50_4132\",\"timestamp\":1781651357},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: And I will search Dawnstar Spire to find the missing piece. Join me when you can, Manyfaced. And Rommath, good luck.\",\"id\":\"s50_4133\",\"timestamp\":1781651362},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Relying on mirror images to unlock multiple wards? Clever. Even in death, he is still teaching me...\",\"id\":\"s50_4134\",\"timestamp\":1781651428},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath conjures several mirror images before teleporting upstairs.\",\"id\":\"s50_4135\",\"timestamp\":1781651449},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar says: One final challenge yet remains, my apprentice.\",\"id\":\"s50_4136\",\"timestamp\":1781651518},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx150\",\"id\":\"s50_4137\",\"timestamp\":1781651592},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: I've managed to unravel most of his wards, but Belo'vir was always... extravagant with his safeguards. I will need your help for this last one.\",\"id\":\"s50_4138\",\"timestamp\":1781651596},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Manyfaced plants the Flag of Ownership in the corpse of Çpa.\",\"id\":\"s50_4139\",\"timestamp\":1781651603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mirror Image of Belo'vir Salonar says: One final challenge yet remains, my apprentice.\",\"id\":\"s50_4140\",\"timestamp\":1781651647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Manyfaced\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|T7549087:12|t|Hitem:274261::::::::90:260:::::::::|h[Grand Magister's Key-Cipher]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s50_4141\",\"timestamp\":1781651670},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"DarkIronDwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Stangin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\"