clout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"b\":0.9215686917304993},\"text\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: Come, my chosen. Witness the fate of this world.\",\"timestamp\":1785175476,\"id\":\"s51_3215\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"b\":0.9215686917304993},\"text\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: Behold the one who shall herald its coming.\",\"timestamp\":1785175484,\"id\":\"s51_3216\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: My dear friends. A wondrous honor has been bestowed upon you. The chance to embrace your destiny, as I have.\",\"timestamp\":1785175491,\"id\":\"s51_3217\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: N'Zoth has shown me the inevitable truth. That to save Azeroth, we must accept his gift.\",\"timestamp\":1785175504,\"id\":\"s51_3218\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: Kneel and serve. It is the only way.\",\"timestamp\":1785175514,\"id\":\"s51_3219\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\"