\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Khaz Algar Engineering skill.\",\"id\":\"s51_4084\",\"timestamp\":1785200076},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Renzik \\\"The Shiv\\\"\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Renzik \\\"The Shiv\\\" says: Hey, you remember that suspicious wall down in the Ringing Deeps? Someone just blasted it to pieces.\",\"id\":\"s51_4085\",\"timestamp\":1785200128},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T134939:12|t|Hitem:111921::::::::90:258::14::1:28:960:::::|h[Draenor Engineering]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s51_4086\",\"timestamp\":1785200194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Draenor Engineering skill.\",\"id\":\"s51_4087\",\"timestamp\":1785200207},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leah Kranz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Leah Kranz says: Fresh bread! Fresh bread for sale!\",\"id\":\"s51_4088\",\"timestamp\":1785200208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Yrel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Yrel says: Prophet, this hero - and many others from another world - have come to aid us.\",\"id\":\"s51_4089\",\"timestamp\":1785200297},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen says: It is good to see you, my child. My people welcome your aid, champion. Come with me.\",\"id\":\"s51_4090\",\"timestamp\":1785200302},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vindicator Maraad\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vindicator Maraad says: Plant your banner, and claim your destiny.\",\"id\":\"s51_4091\",\"timestamp\":1785200310},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Khadgar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Archmage Khadgar says: I can open up a portal to Stormwind only briefly.\",\"id\":\"s51_4092\",\"timestamp\":1785200316},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen says: I do hope my trust in your people is not misplaced.\",\"id\":\"s51_4093\",\"timestamp\":1785200320},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vindicator Maraad\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vindicator Maraad says: I assure you, my Prophet, the commander we've chosen represents the very best of the Alliance.\",\"id\":\"s51_4094\",\"timestamp\":1785200325},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Foreman Zipfizzle\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Foreman Zipfizzle says: Alright, come on through. Steady... Steady...\",\"id\":\"s51_4095\",\"timestamp\":1785200331},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baros Alexston\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Baros Alexston says: This is it, boys! Let's break some ground and take this world for the Alliance!\",\"id\":\"s51_4096\",\"timestamp\":1785200336},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T924155:12|t|Hitem:108918::::::::90:258::11:1:13617:2:9:90:28:63:::::|h[Karabor Arcanist Rod (Two-Hand 40)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s51_4097\",\"timestamp\":1785200354},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baros Alexston\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Baros Alexston says: If you mark those trees, Shelly's lumberjacks will do the rest.\",\"id\":\"s51_4098\",\"timestamp\":1785200355},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baros Alexston\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Baros Alexston says: Giant killer ravens... I have a feeling it's going to be a long, cold night.\",\"id\":\"s51_4099\",\"timestamp\":1785200356},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baros Alexston\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Baros Alexston says: An excellent choice of lumber, if I do say so myself.\",\"id\":\"s51_4100\",\"timestamp\":1785200454},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baros Alexston\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Baros Alexston says: Impressive work, commander. I know I'll sleep a lot better without those giant killer birds flying around.\",\"id\":\"s51_4101\",\"timestamp\":1785200454},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Stoow\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stoow-Tichondrius:1369:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaStoow|r]|h: L\",\"id\":\"s51_4102\",\"timestamp\":1785200464},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Yrel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Yrel says: With the giant defeated we shouldn't have any more trouble clearing out the area.\",\"id\":\"s51_4103\",\"timestamp\":1785200481},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Baros Alexston\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Baros Alexston says: Let me know when you are ready to start construction, commander.\",\"id\":\"s51_4104\",\"timestamp\":1785200487},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Stoow\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stoow-Tichondrius:1379:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaStoow|r]|h: long que time might see if i have an alt i wanna play\",\"id\":\"s51_4105\",\"timestamp\":1785200497},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\