,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: What did Malacrass do to de loa?\",\"timestamp\":1785260944,\"id\":\"s51_4372\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Enchanted Amani Mask\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Enchanted Amani Mask says: Your grandfather asked de loa to help fight de elves and other gokinye. Dey refused.\",\"timestamp\":1785260948,\"id\":\"s51_4373\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Enchanted Amani Mask\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Enchanted Amani Mask says: So Zul'jin and Malacrass decided to take de power dey needed, instead of begging for it.\",\"timestamp\":1785260957,\"id\":\"s51_4374\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|T1500877:12|t|Hitem:262752::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Vilebranch Scroll]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1785260965,\"id\":\"s51_4375\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|T1500877:12|t|Hitem:262752::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Vilebranch Scroll]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1785260975,\"id\":\"s51_4376\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1