name\":\"Murky-Frostmane\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Murky-Frostmane:404:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Murky-Frostmane|r]|h: any healers 2300+ want to que blitz\",\"timestamp\":1785261014,\"id\":\"s51_4383\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|T1500877:12|t|Hitem:262752::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Vilebranch Scroll]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1785261017,\"id\":\"s51_4384\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Jan-boy, dis has gone far enough. We must stop following Malacrass's footsteps! Lest we anger de loa.\",\"timestamp\":1785261034,\"id\":\"s51_4385\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: De loa? If we can harness Ula'tek's power, we will not need de loa.\",\"timestamp\":1785261042,\"id\":\"s51_4386\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: How can you say dat? De loa made your sister hash'ey! Dey helped us defeat de Twilight's Blade!\",\"timestamp\":1785261048,\"id\":\"s51_4387\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: What about when de elves invaded our lands? When de Trollbanes hunted our people? When my grandfather was tortured?\",\"timestamp\":1785261056,\"id\":\"s51_4388\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: And still, we had to beg them to aid us against the Twilight's Blade.\",\"timestamp\":1785261065,\"id\":\"s51_4389\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: No, Uncle. We must take the power we need to protect the Amani, like my grandfather did.\",\"timestamp\":1785261073,\"id\":\"s51_4390\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Your grandfather led de Amani to catastrophe, Zul'jan!\",\"timestamp\":1785261083,\"id\":\"s51_4391\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: My grandfather did what was needed. The Amani stand alone. And the Amani never die.\",\"timestamp\":1785261088,\"id\":\"s51_4392\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Prepare yourselves. Necromancy is a serious matter. We need to stop the Vilebranch.\",\"timestamp\":1785261124,\"id\":\"s51_4393\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Everyone get your buffs on.\",\"timestamp\":1785261127,\"id\":\"s51_4394\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: A mage table for all your summoned food needs.\",\"timestamp\":1785261129,\"id\":\"s51_4395\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: Check your adventure guide if you need more information about what we'll find here.\",\"timestamp\":1785261131,\"id\":\"s51_4396\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Neonvoid. Oraka'zul! I am blessed ya be here to prowl with me.\",\"timestamp\":1785261159,\"id\":\"s51_4397\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Frenzied Berserker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Frenzied Berserker yells: Intruders! Cut dem down!\",\"timestamp\":1785261159,\"id\":\"s51_4398\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: I have used de shadows to see inside de cavern. I have seen my people--dead, alive, or... both.\",\"timestamp\":1785261164,\"id\":\"s51_4399\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: I'll keep you safe. Follow me.\",\"timestamp\":1785261170,\"id\":\"s51_4400\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: I fear they be sacrificed for some dark purpose. Come. I will guide you. We gonna rescue my people.\",\"timestamp\":1785261175,\"id\":\"s51_4401\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|T134339:12|t|Hitem:260614::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1785261194,\"id\":\"s51_4402\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Neonvoid\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|T5931164:12|t|Hitem:251923::::::::90:258:::::::::|h[Thalassian Essence of the Faire]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1785261194,\"id\":\"s51_4403\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Steeww\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.25098040699