TER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amani Summoner says: Ula'tek! Ula'tek! Ula'tek!\",\"timestamp\":1786490688,\"id\":\"s52_3440\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Fabled Priestess\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Fabled Priestess says: Ula'tek! Ula'tek! Ula'tek!\",\"timestamp\":1786490688,\"id\":\"s52_3441\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: No! This must be lies! De Amani alone won this victory!\",\"timestamp\":1786490692,\"id\":\"s52_3442\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: We will discover de truth of this, gokinye.\",\"timestamp\":1786490704,\"id\":\"s52_3443\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: What he means to say is you have our thanks for sharing dis with us. And we must return to Zul'Aman to investigate.\",\"timestamp\":1786490709,\"id\":\"s52_3444\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: I can speed your return. Roots guide your path.\",\"timestamp\":1786490717,\"id\":\"s52_3445\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Stormclout! Help me search through Uncle's things while he communes with de loa.\",\"timestamp\":1786490741,\"id\":\"s52_3446\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Akil'zon says dey know nothing of Ula'tek. Strange.\",\"timestamp\":1786490744,\"id\":\"s52_3447\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Numazon? Yes! Those tablets are ancient and worth searching for clues.\",\"timestamp\":1786490750,\"id\":\"s52_3448\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Because de Amani alone earned de victory.\",\"timestamp\":1786490751,\"id\":\"s52_3449\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: See! De Amani stood alone. No loa! No gokinye!\",\"timestamp\":1786490758,\"id\":\"s52_3450\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Befuddled Amani Mask\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Befuddled Amani Mask says: Get away! Leave me alone!\",\"timestamp\":1786490765,\"id\":\"s52_3451\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: And how many Amani died dat day, Jan-boy?\",\"timestamp\":1786490766,\"id\":\"s52_3452\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: A spirit mask! Grab it!\",\"timestamp\":1786490770,\"id\":\"s52_3453\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: I never owned a mask like that. Where did it come from? Bring it here, Stormclout.\",\"timestamp\":1786490776,\"id\":\"s52_3454\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Befuddled Amani Mask\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Befuddled Amani Mask says: Who are you? Don't hurt me!\",\"timestamp\":1786490780,\"id\":\"s52_3455\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You are damaged, friend! Stormclout, grab my tools and some supplies.\",\"timestamp\":1786490785,\"id\":\"s52_3456\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Befuddled Amani Mask\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Befuddled Amani Mask says: Dey attacked de city. Dey trie